MORPH — PART I: Daylight Awakening 🪘

Last month I was so lucky to be part of the crew at @morphfest 

I spent three days filming incredible artists, dancers, yogis, workshops…
I can’t wait for you to see the aftermovie (currently in the making)

But in the meantime…
I’ve created a 3-part series to give you a taste! 

Part I is… Culture. Drums. Ritual. Energy 
Light. Art. Sound. Inspiration. Vibrations. Respect.
It is human connection in motion.

This is how it begins.

Thank you to the entire crew and everyone who participated, for giving me all these beautiful images and moments to capture🫶

Special thanks to the organisers @itsleahluna , @thebuzzykiwi , @stephenblase , @lorenhoney_ , @lunar.landing , and to the amazing @stace_shot_me for believing in me.

