MORPH — PART III: Transformation

This is the world of @morphfest . 
Music, movement, connection. 
Strangers becoming one, while completely lost within themselves.

Moments of freedom and expression, shared through rhythm, art, and human connection.

Thank you for letting me capture such intimate, unique, and personal moments. It was beautiful.

Well done, and thank you to everyone for sharing so much of yourselves through your art and work.

I’m still looking for all the artists to properly credit them, share more content, keep following your art, support you, and hopefully collaborate in the future.

If you were at MORPH, send me a DM or write your name in the comments ✨

