The Mentals ! What an iconic Sydney band they were. Their debut album released  in 1979. Hit after hit after hit we sung along to throughout the 80s. 

At @mullumrootsfestival we were treated to so many of those hits and again we got to sing along. 
What an absolute treat. I never saw this coming. 

Original co-founding members missing but never forgotten ✨Legendary Greedy Smith who passed away in 2019 and Martin Plaza who retired from performing in 2015. Integral members … but the show (now) goes on. 

Other original members Reg Mombassa and brother Peter O’Doherty reformed the group late last year with Peter’s son Declan O’Doherty on drums, Shannon Stitt on keyboards and Simon Rudston-Brown doing a mighty fine job on lead vocals and guitar. 

What a talented bunch. 

They sold out Sydney’s @enmore_theatre a few weeks ago and have more shows up north coming up. 

In case you’d forgotten the array of songs they made popular all those decades ago, here’s a reminder . 
I know many who would love to see them but won’t get to, so I share a little of the joy of the night 🩵

