Shall we do it again sometime?? 👀

Our first edition began in Denpasar, marking the start of Tangi’s journey to revive street art in Bali after the pandemic.

Carrying the theme “Paras Paros”, a Balinese philosophy that reflects harmony, togetherness, and mutual respect, the festival brought artists together to transform public walls into shared stories.

Over several weeks, murals appeared across the city, created by @ijalmariachi
@Dwymabim
@Yessiow
@zolalongor 
@theunclejoy
@_loostmind and 
@alfanmtv 

Each wall became part of a growing conversation between artists, communities, and the surrounding urban landscape.

As Tangi continues to grow, we often look back at where it all started. This mural map is a small reflection of our first steps, reminding us of the beginning and the spirit that brought us together.

#TangiStreetArtFestival #TangiSAF2023 #ParasParos #StreetArtBali

