Tangi Street Art Festival 2024

For the second edition of Tangi Street Art Festival, we took a different path. Leaving the city behind, Tangi traveled north and found its home among the mountain villages of Bali.

Surrounded by forests, farms, and lake landscapes, the festival explored how street art could exist beyond urban spaces and become part of everyday village life. Walls that once blended quietly into the landscape slowly transformed into vibrant murals, creating new conversations between art, nature, and community.

The 2024 edition brought together artists including @lauradevitaa 
